ct his dna  but i'm still kind of leaning towards  that picture being the clue that's going  to break things wide open  either way it's clear that mayer was  thinking about how he might be connected  to things  after hearing he lived with aaron billy  isn't looking like the best suspect  anymore  although i think it is possible that he  could still be the father  but this whole situation with ryan and  john is really starting to make you  wonder if jon isn't actually the one we  need to be looking at  he made a point of providing an alibi  for frank which also gave him an alibi  for that night  that certainly feels suspicious the  whole way that the idea of the affair  played out seems a little bit suspicious  too  laurie put the answers into ryan's mouth  he never said it himself he only nodded  yes at the end  and he could have been trying to make  the whole thing stop  those two might be carrying a big secret  the reason billy looks so suspicious all  the time might also be because he knows  about it  and in this trailer it looks like he has  some kind of culpability  or he was doing something that he was  trying to cover up that their father  knows about  i think there's a good chance that what  ryan knows will play a big part in  figuring out the end  i think finding out dj's father will  also be key  and it's kind of exciting that john's  father's going to him to tell him  something  where he might be giving that  information up to the exact wrong person  even if jon isn't guilty he would  probably cover things up for his brother  and considering that they've made the  choice to present mare as a crooked cop  it does leave things open and make you  wonder how she'll react to that  considering that laurie's her best  friend based on removing the characters  i've mentioned  if it's not jon who does that leave  richard siobhan  laurie father dan ryan and frank and  faye  ryan's a kid and he would have had to  get there with a gun  and get the body to the river after that  would involve an  accomplice but it would also involve him  being a killer  it seems more likely he probably found  out something he wasn't supposed to  it might spill the beans father dan is  the same  all things considered he isn't very  shady  i think richard serves an obvious  purpose to be there for mayor after what  happened to colin  we've seen them kissing in the last  trailer and know that he's still trying  to be in her life  there may be ulterior motives involved  or he  may have more secrets but they would  have to do a hard  turn to setting it up for it to make  sense for him to be revealed as the  killer at this point  yes guy pierce is a well-known actor and  he does seem to be a little  underutilized  right now but in all the press materials  he is listed below  lori helen siobhan and colin i mean if  mayer found that ross family reunion  shirt at his place that would definitely  change things  but short of something like that i think  richard is low on the suspect list  lori seems like a stretch to me all the  way around in the last episode we saw  her husband leave the house when she  found out he was having an affair  would she really kill a sweet single  teen mother that they  know personally because she found out  that she was abused by that same husband  siobhan's role in the big picture is a  little unclear  i said a few episodes back that i  thought she was there  she has the documentary in that she was  a connection to kevin in that period of  time for mayor  it also seems like she's the only  character who has a chance to get out of  east town  and her splitting with becca makes it  seem really unlikely that they would  have had secrets about that  night together there is this persisting  theory that kevin hooked up with aaron  and he's the one who's really dj's  father and that could be something that  siobhan could find out but i don't  really  see how that would be all that important  to the story  if you play it all the way out it would  just mean that mare has two grandkids at  the end instead of one  there is something going on with frank  and faye but neither one of them seem  like killers to me  and they're really not on my suspect  list at this time  in the end i think jon is the best  suspect at this point  is he dj's dad maybe is billy the dad  and john knows and he's been covering  for him this whole time  maybe it could be the other way around  it could be  that jon killed aaron to protect his  brother or  vice versa we'll have to wait and see i  think jess ryan and laurie will be the  key players  in bringing the information to mayor  then we'll see how it all plays out  and what kind of effect it has on east  town i think that's a good place to  leave it  please like this video if you enjoyed it  let me know in the comments what you  think  who are your top suspects where do you  think this thing's going what other  secrets keep kicking around in your  brain  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already i'll be doing two mayor  of east town videos again next week so  make sure you check  back thanks for watching i'll talk to  you soon
 

